        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur WINBELCOM, Windsor Plate With Bellagio Lever Combo</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWindsor Plate With Bellagio Lever Combo Grandeur WINWINCOM - Intricately detailed, the ornate Windsor Plate With Bellagio Lever Single Cylinder Combo features a fanciful design that is dripping with elegance. The Bellagio Lever's simple lines draw attention to the beautiful detailing on the rose and deadbolt. The scroll embellishments of the Windsor Entry Set will surely add glamor to your home. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Single Cylinder Windsor Entry Set with Bellagio Lever fits doors 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. It is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware and has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-windsor-series\"><b>Windsor Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur WINBELCOM Windsor Plate With Bellagio Lever Single Cylinder Combo:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Windsor Plate With Bellagio Lever Combo:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Height: 8.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Width: 2.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Length: 4.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Projection: 1.90\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 4.20\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.55\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WIN-plate.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Windsor Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BEL-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Bellagio Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WIN-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Windsor Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
